<section class="op2-access__body op2-access__chooser-body">
  <p>Escolha o tipo de desafio que deseja iniciar.</p>
  <div class="op2-access__choice-row">
    <button class="op2-access__choice op2-access__choice--unlock" type="button" data-action="unlock"><span class="op2-access__lock-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>Destrancar</strong><small>Descubra a sequência correta antes de esgotar as tentativas.</small></button>
    <button class="op2-access__choice op2-access__choice--break" type="button" data-action="break"><img class="op2-access__break-icon" src="systems/ordemparanormal2/assets/icons/access-challenges/break.svg" alt="" /><strong>Arrombar</strong><small>Force a abertura com Atletismo, consumindo PV e reduzindo a resistência.</small></button>
  </div>
  <button class="op2-access__text-button" type="button" data-action="cancel">Cancelar</button>
</section>
